  32:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     STM32L0 devices integrate one or two 12-bit Digital Analog Converters
  33:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     (i.e. one or 2 channel(s))
  34:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     1 channel : STM32L05x STM32L06x devices
  35:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     2 channels: STM32L07x STM32L08x devices
  36:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  37:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     When 2 channels are available, the 2 converters (i.e. channel1 & channel2)
  38:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     can be used independently or simultaneously (dual mode):
  39:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) DAC channel1 with DAC_OUT1 (PA4) as output
  40:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) DAC channel2 with DAC_OUT2 (PA5) as output (STM32L07x/STM32L08x only)
  41:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) Channel1 & channel2 can be used independently or simultaneously in dual mode (STM32L07x/S
  42:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  43:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** DAC Triggers ***
  44:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       ====================
  45:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  46:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     Digital to Analog conversion can be non-triggered using DAC_TRIGGER_NONE
  47:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     and DAC_OUT1/DAC_OUT2 is available once writing to DHRx register.
  48:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  49:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     Digital to Analog conversion can be triggered by:
  50:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) External event: EXTI Line 9 (any GPIOx_PIN_9) using DAC_TRIGGER_EXT_IT9.
  51:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****           The used pin (GPIOx_PIN_9) must be configured in input mode.
  52:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  53:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) Timers TRGO:
  54:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****           STM32L05x/STM32L06x : TIM2, TIM6 and TIM21
  55:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****           STM32L07x/STM32L08x : TIM2, TIM3, TIM6, TIM7 and TIM21
  56:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****           (DAC_TRIGGER_T2_TRGO, DAC_TRIGGER_T6_TRGO...)
  57:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  58:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) Software using DAC_TRIGGER_SOFTWARE
  59:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  60:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** DAC Buffer mode feature ***
  61:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       ===============================
  62:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
  63:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       Each DAC channel integrates an output buffer that can be used to
  64:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       reduce the output impedance, and to drive external loads directly
  65:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       without having to add an external operational amplifier.
  66:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       To enable, the output buffer use
  67:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       sConfig.DAC_OutputBuffer = DAC_OUTPUTBUFFER_ENABLE;
  68:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
  69:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (@) Refer to the device datasheet for more details about output
  70:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****           impedance value with and without output buffer.
  71:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  72:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DAC wave generation feature ***
  73:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        ===================================
  74:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
  75:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        Both DAC channels can be used to generate
  76:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) Noise wave using HAL_DACEx_NoiseWaveGenerate()
  77:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) Triangle wave using HAL_DACEx_TriangleWaveGenerate()
  78:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  79:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DAC data format ***
  80:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        =======================
  81:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
  82:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        The DAC data format can be:
  83:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) 8-bit right alignment using DAC_ALIGN_8B_R
  84:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) 12-bit left alignment using DAC_ALIGN_12B_L
  85:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) 12-bit right alignment using DAC_ALIGN_12B_R
  86:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  87:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DAC data value to voltage correspondence ***
  88:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        ================================================
ARM GAS  /var/folders/d7/pb3dkhys6j3db_qtp_8v34p80000gn/T//cc56OpCZ.s 			page 3


  89:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
  90:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        The analog output voltage on each DAC channel pin is determined
  91:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        by the following equation:
  92:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
  93:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        DAC_OUTx = VREF+ * DOR / 4095
  94:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) with  DOR is the Data Output Register
  95:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
  96:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****           VEF+ is the input voltage reference (refer to the device datasheet)
  97:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
  98:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****         e.g. To set DAC_OUT1 to 0.7V, use
  99:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Assuming that VREF+ = 3.3V, DAC_OUT1 = (3.3 * 868) / 4095 = 0.7V
 100:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 101:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DMA requests  ***
 102:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        =====================
 103:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 104:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        A DMA1 request can be generated when an external trigger (but not a software trigger)
 105:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        occurs if DMA1 requests are enabled using HAL_DAC_Start_DMA().
 106:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        DMA1 requests are mapped as following:
 107:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) DAC channel1 : mapped on DMA1 Request9 channel2 which must be
 108:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****              already configured
 109:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) DAC channel2 : mapped on DMA1 Request15 channel4 which must be
 110:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****              already configured (STM32L07x/STM32L08x only)
 111:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 112:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     -@- For Dual mode (STM32L07x/STM32L08x only) and specific signal (Triangle and noise) generatio
 113:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****         refer to Extension Features Driver description
 114:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 115:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 116:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****                       ##### How to use this driver #####
 117:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****   ==============================================================================
 118:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
 119:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) DAC APB clock must be enabled to get write access to DAC
 120:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****           registers using HAL_DAC_Init()
 121:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Configure DAC_OUT1: PA4 in analog mode.
 122:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Configure DAC_OUT2: PA5 in analog mode (STM32L07x/STM32L08x only).
 123:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Configure the DAC channel using HAL_DAC_ConfigChannel() function.
 124:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Enable the DAC channel using HAL_DAC_Start() or HAL_DAC_Start_DMA functions
 125:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 126:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****      *** Polling mode IO operation ***
 127:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****      =================================
 128:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****      [..]
 129:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Start the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Start()
 130:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) To read the DAC last data output value, use the HAL_DAC_GetValue() function.
 131:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Stop the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Stop()
 132:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 133:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****      *** DMA mode IO operation ***
 134:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****      ==============================
 135:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****      [..]
 136:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Start the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Start_DMA(), at this stage the user specify the l
 137:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****            of data to be transferred at each end of conversion
 138:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) At the middle of data transfer HAL_DAC_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh1()or HAL_DAC_ConvHalfCpltC
 139:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****            function is executed and user can add his own code by customization of function pointer
 140:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****            HAL_DAC_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh1 or HAL_DAC_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh2
 141:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) At The end of data transfer HAL_DAC_ConvCpltCallbackCh1()or HAL_DAC_ConvCpltCallbackCh2(
 142:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****            function is executed and user can add his own code by customization of function pointer
 143:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****            HAL_DAC_ConvCpltCallbackCh1 or HAL_DAC_ConvCpltCallbackCh2
 144:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) In case of transfer Error, HAL_DAC_ErrorCallbackCh1() function is executed and user can
 145:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****            add his own code by customization of function pointer HAL_DAC_ErrorCallbackCh1
ARM GAS  /var/folders/d7/pb3dkhys6j3db_qtp_8v34p80000gn/T//cc56OpCZ.s 			page 4


 146:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) In case of DMA underrun, DAC interruption triggers and execute internal function HAL_DAC
 147:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****            HAL_DAC_DMAUnderrunCallbackCh1()or HAL_DAC_DMAUnderrunCallbackCh2()
 148:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****            function is executed and user can add his own code by customization of function pointer
 149:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****            HAL_DAC_DMAUnderrunCallbackCh1 or HAL_DAC_DMAUnderrunCallbackCh2
 150:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****            add his own code by customization of function pointer HAL_DAC_ErrorCallbackCh1
 151:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Stop the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Stop_DMA()
