 421:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
 422:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Start conversion.
 423:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Stop conversion.
 424:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Start conversion and enable DMA transfer.
 425:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Stop conversion and disable DMA transfer.
 426:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Get result of conversion.
 427:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Get result of dual mode conversion (STM32L07xx/STM32L08xx only)
 428:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 429:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_dac.c **** @endverbatim
